.meshy-task-state/

# Local source asset archives and bulky generated candidates
apps/aura-clash-showcase/assets/candidates/
apps/aura-clash-showcase/assets/quaternius-source/
apps/aura-clash-showcase/assets/source/
apps/aura-clash-showcase/assets/quaternius-*.json
apps/world-war-x-showcase/
marketing/public/aura-assets/

# Curated production marketing previews.
!marketing/public/previews/showcase/*.png
.visual-iter/
# Reproducible typed C1 extension-map analytical fixtures (CLI producer owned).
!tests/browser/fixtures/
tests/browser/fixtures/*
!tests/browser/fixtures/c1-extension/
!tests/browser/fixtures/c1-extension/**
.local-evidence/
# Local AI-agent control files; public guidance lives in llms.txt and docs/agents/.
AGENTS.md
**/AGENTS.md
# Generated skill-mirror copies are committed (check:skills mirrors canonical).
!**/skills/agent-files/AGENTS.md
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.cursor/rules/
.github/copilot-instructions.md
# PRD-13 T2.15: agent files shipped as template/skills content (not local control files).
!packages/aura3d-cli/skills/agent-files/AGENTS.md
!packages/create-aura3d/templates/*/AGENTS.md
!packages/create-aura3d/templates/*/.claude/CLAUDE.md
!templates/*/AGENTS.md
!templates/*/.claude/CLAUDE.md
